<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26467" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεῖδον</span></b> , inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διϊδεῖν,</span>
		aor. 2 with no pres. in use (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διοράω</span> being used), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>see thoroughly, discern</i> (on the Homeric usage 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-είδω</span>
			)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					168
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				264c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος οὐ ῥᾴδιος διϊδεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					62b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>see through:</i>—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διειδομένη ἐν ὕδατι νῆσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Del.</u>
					191
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτραπὸς . . διειδομένη πεδίοιο</span>
			<i>seen through</i> or <i>across</i> the plain, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.546
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίοιδα,</span>
			inf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διειδέναι,</span>
			
				Ep.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διίδμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.1360
				</span></i>
			, <i>distinguish, discern,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρῶν . . τὸν κακὸν διειδέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					518
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				975
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				262a
			</span></i>: fut., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διείσεται ἡ χείρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					8.36.6
				</span></i>
			; <i>decide,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				295
			</span></i>.</div>
